VALUES (939663, 'tt0003151', NULL, 'The Mirror', 'The Mirror', 'movie', 1913, NULL, NULL, 'The girl''s lessons from the young station agent on the manipulation of the telegraph code served her in good stead. By it, hemmed in on all sides at the lonely farmhouse, she was able to save both herself and her father''s money from desperate tramps, an experience which is grippingly illustrated in this Biograph melodrama.', NULL, NULL, 0.4081, 0.0, 0, 1.05, '2026-11-22 13:01:12', '2026-11-22 13:01:12')
