VALUES (837335, 'tt14561712', NULL, 'La Chimera', 'La chimera', 'movie', 2023, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dV6SYHmmFLXQU7oKRfK4pOFCX6M.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ovtTn2GkzOYsMvAVWl6Bt0jN4Ye.jpg', 'Everyone has their own Chimera, something they try to achieve but never manage to find. For Arthur, the Chimera looks like the woman he lost, Beniamina. In an adventurous journey between the living and the dead, between forests and cities, between celebrations and solitudes, the intertwined destinies of these characters unfold, all in search of the Chimera.', NULL, NULL, 4.2035, 7.3, 0, 1.43216666666666654e+01, '2026-07-20 04:02:06', '2026-11-22 13:01:12')
