VALUES (4543, 'tt0085959', NULL, 'Monty Python''s The Meaning of Life', 'Monty Python''s The Meaning of Life', 'movie', 1983, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yavZ9WgEZIpWi2EbVW8At9RPdo.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eIcJq4QDmToJeu4g6fS4iLPKY8n.jpg', 'Life''s questions are ''answered'' in a series of outrageous vignettes, beginning with a staid London insurance company which transforms before our eyes into a pirate ship. Then there''s the National Health doctors who try to claim a healthy liver from a still-living donor. The world''s most voracious glutton brings the art of vomiting to new heights before his spectacular demise.', NULL, NULL, 3.9476, 7.3, 0, 3.01, '2026-08-27 07:35:55', '2026-11-22 13:01:12')
